WEBVTT

NOTE
Every line, for anyone who needs the words larger than the picture draws
them: caption styles in the OS (size, color, background) reach this track,
never the captions drawn into the picture. Off by default; the default track
is fathom-film.en.vtt. Every spoken cue is a line of COPY_13.film.transcript
(lib/copy-13.ts), held to it by test/film.test.tsx. Times are measured from
the film's voice and chime tracks; re-time both tracks when its audio changes.

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.000
Narrator: fathom is an assistant
with vision, for blind and low-vision people.

2
00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.750
It used to have five modes.

3
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.950
You had to pick one
before you could ask anything.

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.900
Now it’s one conversation.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.600
You just ask.

6
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.800
[Mellow guitar music]

7
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.700
[Listening chime]
You: What’s in front of me?

8
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.500
[Heard chime]

9
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.200
fathom: A stainless steel kettle
and your pour-over coffee setup

10
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.200
are about 6 feet away,
at your 11 o’clock.

11
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.300
Be careful, just in case
there’s hot water in the kettle.

12
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.800
[Listening chime]
You: What does this say?

13
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:32.600
[Heard chime]

14
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.200
fathom: It’s October’s electric bill.

15
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.900
It’s $84.77, due by the 12th.

16
00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:40.300
Would you like me
to read all the details?

17
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.700
[Listening chime]
You: Where did I leave my keys?

18
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.480
[Heard chime]

19
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.450
fathom: You told me they’re
on the hook by the door.

20
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.500
I remember what you tell me.

21
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.800
[Listening chime]
You: Take me to the kitchen.

22
00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:58.620
[Heard chime]

23
00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:01.300
fathom: Keep heading forward
for about 12 feet,

24
00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.100
and then the door to the kitchen
will be at 9 o’clock.

25
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.300
You’ll notice a change in the floor texture,
because it’s tile.

26
00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.200
Narrator: fathom is live on the App Store,
free to download.

27
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.350
Find it at fathomvision.app.

28
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.500
Made to be heard.
